description: >
  The burst of adrenaline pumping through you grants you unimaginable power, damaging your body in the aftermath.
text: >
  Power and Payment: The burst of adrenaline pumping through you grants you unimaginable power, damaging your body in the aftermath.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Gain 2 Actions. After leaving this Transformation, gain the Drained Combat Condition and reduce your Life Points by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Maximum Life Points.

